 "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-12-23T19:37:51Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "The Shivaji was introduced alongwith Aurangzeb", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-12-23T19:37:59Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Which obv created a controversy", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-12-23T19:38:10Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "So they changed aurangzeb to narasimhavarma", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]